title: IP or location lookup on a lure page
severity: medium
score: 20
tags: evasion, geofencing
attack: T1614, T1497
description: The page queried a client-side IP/ASN/geo lookup service and also showed a
  credential, ClickFix or download lure: geofencing or sandbox filtering.
---
// The page looks up the visitor's IP address or location ...
ip_lookups
// ... and asks for a secret, puts a command on the clipboard or starts a risky download.
| where exists(brand_secret_page)
    or exists(clipboard_commands)
    or exists(unprompted_risky_downloads)
    or exists(secret_prompts)
